{"item_id": "feed:https://soldiersystems.net/2026/10/14/arkeus-warden-hyperspectral-optical-radar-enters-australian-army-service/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=arkeus-warden-hyperspectral-optical-radar-enters-australian-army-service", "version_id": "2e678b344ac42150b9d9469811990eb6350d1930c4c6f9047b0b713b9c02b3f6", "decision": "reject", "reason": "Out of scope under the Relevance rule: this is a military ISR sensor (hyperspectral optical radar on the Insitu Integrator UAS) with no connection to the listed competitor gear categories or Mammoth conditions. The text is a manufacturer press release with no independent testing, so it also fails the Credibility and Unsupported claims rules.", "piece_ids": []}
